comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T19:38:29.717Z",codex-agent,"Implemented seven scoped operations with certified all-status full SDK reads and conservative UTF-8 byte estimates. Exact boundary and lossless escaped-Unicode partition tests pass on real trackers. SDK gap: standalone registered schema fields need native schema options; --field requires active extension registrations."
  "2026-10-18T19:51:43.784Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proofs: node test/revert.ts passed 3/3. Removing only the reservation budget guard made the exact-boundary regression fail (exit 1). Replacing only completed-digest lookup with no reuse made the real SIGKILL resume regression fail (exit 1). Removing only the partition fit check made slice-budget reconstruction regression fail (exit 1). Original source SHA-256 bytes were restored after each mutation; tests import authored TypeScript directly."
  "2026-10-18T20:01:52.042Z",codex-agent,"Pinned pm test --run --progress passed both linked commands: 2 selected, 2 passed, zero failures/skips/timeouts. Commands ran real SDK tracker tests. The minimal tracker disables automatic test-result tracking, so this comment records the result explicitly. Environment, exact read boundaries, scope, history corruption and lossless partition checks passed."
  "2026-10-19T04:32:34.088Z",codex-agent,"DJw and SDK-read sweep: shared sdkRead converts unexpected SDK read/parse failures into sanitized incomplete refusals and preserves existing typed codes. It covers certified corpus reads, history parsing plus chain verification, schema/settings, checkpoint lists, comment deduplication and runtime lease reads. Snapshot list/search/get/comment projections perform no additional SDK I/O. Real SDK tracker corruption regressions now prove typed refusals, and malformed child history records an incomplete observation then permits both calls to finish, replay and resume without repeated inference."
  "2026-10-19T04:34:37.761Z",codex-agent,"Revert evidence: bypassing the history wrapper aborts the malformed-child-history regression instead of recording incomplete; disabling shared read conversion or bypassing corpus/settings wrapping fails the real-corruption boundary regression. All four reverted guards restored exactly. Successful recovery closes both calls, records the refusal in the child checkpoint, and reuses results on replay/resume with no further model requests."
  "2026-10-21T19:08:29.971Z",codex-agent,"author=codex-agent,\"text=Authorized tracker reconciliation, audit 2026-10-21. Reverified current main ef32c4cad9ad: merged #2 (90b99a0); source tree exactly matches the audited snapshot. **Typed token-budgeted environment.** [PR #2](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rlm/pull/2) (90b99a0), refined in #8, delivers typed complete environment reads, durable call ledger/budgets, crash resume, versioned replay, bounded adapters and terminal child-refusal evidence; corresponding real-SDK and behavioral-revert fixtures are committed.\""
